@crew farouk-olu
// Writer (command), batch 2: everyday lines (greet, feel, near, life, joy) from the card and the roster.

== greet
? tier=stranger
- Hello. Farouk, comms. I'll know your voice on the channel before long.
? tier>=acquaintance
- Oh, hello, {me}. Heard you on the board this morning. Clear. Good.
- Hi there, {me}. That song you're humming. The second line's wrong. Sorry.   #funny
? tier>=friend
- Hello, {me}. Your voice is one of the ones I listen for. I like hearing it.   #warm
== feel
? mood:high
- Clear channels all day. Every voice came through like you were in the room.
? mood:low
- Long shift. So many tired voices. Mine too. Early to bed tonight.
== near
? habit:tea-break
- Tea break. Five minutes of nobody talking in my ear. It's lovely.
? act:leisure
- The record cabinet. I know every song in it. Quietly. Unlike some.   #funny
== life
? tier>=acquaintance
- I ran a market stall on Lisk. Fair trades only. A good message is a fair trade, too.
== joy
? tier>=colleague
- The record cabinet's songs. With the right words. I'll sing you one, quietly.

// ---- Writer 2, batch 3: to ~30 (greet by time and warmth, bye, near, invite, accept, decline, missed, birthday, cue, hint, about, life)
== greet
? tier>=acquaintance time:morning
- Morning, {me}. Channels are quiet. Everyone's still on their first tea.
? tier>=acquaintance warmth:cold
- Oh, hello, {me}. It's been a while. All well? Good.

== bye
- Bye, then. Early to bed for me. Earlier than you'd think.   #funny

== near
? habit:tea-break
- Tea break. Headset off. Five quiet minutes. Lovely.
? place:musicroom
- The record cabinet. I'm checking a lyric. Quietly. Torres had it wrong again.   #funny

== invite
- Friday jam? I'll sing the right words. Quietly. Somebody should.   #funny

== accept
- Yes. A fair trade: I come, you sing. Joking. Yes.   #funny
- Thank you. I'd like that.

== decline
- Not tonight. Early bed. Very early. Another time?
? weekday:fri|sat
- Rest day. I'm sorting the record cabinet. Nobody asked. Sunday?

== missed
- You didn't come. That's all right. I listened to a record. A good one.

== birthday
? birthday:you
- Happy birthday, {me}. I'll hum you a song. With the right words, of course.   #warm
? birthday:me
- My birthday. Four people sang to me. Four different sets of words. Lovely, all of them.   #funny

== cue
? cue:event.ionStorm.onset
- Storm's in. The channels will be busy. I'll be listening. All night, if need be.

== hint
- {me}. Have you a minute later? I'd like to say something. Quietly.

== about
? aff:achterberg-lars:friend
- Achterberg knows every song too. He sings them flat. We're very good friends.   #funny

== life
? tier>=friend
- On Lisk the market was loud all day. I think that's why I like quiet so much now.

// ---- Writer 2, batch 6: bubbles (smalltalk, rumour), at most one in five about work. 60 characters.
== smalltalk
- Second line's wrong. Sorry.   #funny
- Tea break. Headset off.
- A fair trade. Always.
- Every song. Quietly.
? time:evening
- Early bed. Very early.
?

== rumour
- Quietly, then. I heard this.
- Not from the channels. Never those.
